        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "LWK/ Keane Mahony Smith are delighted to bring to the market a house on the south Douglas Rd with parking, a rare find! Single storey house in need of total refurbishment but it’s on a wonderful site which has a back entrance with parking for one car.\r\n\r\nThe original house covers an area of 45m2 while the remainer is an extension to the rear. The property has huge potential with an overall floor close on 70m excluding the attached garage to the rear which can also be brought into play\r\n\r\nThe property needs major works to bring it to an acceptable standard.\r\n\r\n***All information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost of care and attention has been placed on providing factual and correct information. In certain cases some information may have been provided by the vendor to us. We do not hold any responsibility for mistakes, errors or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give each and every viewer the right to get an opinion on any concern they may have***"
